    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players become a member of the defense force to protect the earth and fight against the approaching extraterrestrial forces. Let's protect the future of the human race together.</p><br><strong>Game Structure</strong><br>The overall volume of the game is about 30 minutes, consisting of compact 10-minute games.<br>The main game is to aim for a high score in survival mode.<br>- Survival mode with a round-based system to keep fighting the oncoming enemies<br>- A campaign that also serves as a tutorial<br>- Other challenge modes, etc.<br><br><strong>Features</strong><br>- Animated characters<br>- Can be played in a short period of time<br>- Aiming and shooting feel<br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller support is planned for the future, but a PS4 DualShock may be work at this time.</p>",
